{"reviewId": "200943776_89MfuvmQ2", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "黄金的两大属性：商品属性与信用对冲属性。\n在康波复苏和繁荣期，黄金的商品属性更强，黄金价格随着大众商品周期而波动；\n在康波衰退和萧条期，黄金的信用对冲属性显现，与实体信用和美元信用成负相关。这期间，实际利率的长期趋势是黄金价格的长期走势的核心变量。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "12199-12292", "abstract": "美国实体经济增长旺盛、美元体系稳固的阶段，黄金的信用对冲属性被暂时弱化，商品属性成为主导，所以，在长波繁荣阶段黄金价格的运行可能与实际利率的走势发生背离（见图13-12、图13-13）。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "200943776_89MfuvmQ2", "userVid": 200943776, "topics": [], "createTime": 1781155980, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 200943776, "name": "鳳祥", "avatar": "https://mmhead.c2c.wechat.com/mmhead/LDbDuVBMjdykHMQ1wb9O8ibj9X4dqYJ0QotSvWYq7WVUzXfjLwK7YdDONeD1VOzQT7oAFmGA1kQ8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "医疗", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "活在当下，享受过程", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-2000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 2000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 200943776, "name": "鳳祥", "avatar": "https://mmhead.c2c.wechat.com/mmhead/LDbDuVBMjdykHMQ1wb9O8ibj9X4dqYJ0QotSvWYq7WVUzXfjLwK7YdDONeD1VOzQT7oAFmGA1kQ8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "医疗", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "活在当下，享受过程", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-2000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 2000}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{